WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.046 --> 00:00:05.631
Earlier that day Wukong had been in a gloomy swamp, looking for his friends.

2
00:00:05.632 --> 00:00:08.585
"They never learn!" he said.

3
00:00:08.586 --> 00:00:12.929
"I left them here for two minutes. Now they're gone!"

4
00:00:12.930 --> 00:00:16.935
Just then he spotted two demons sitting on a log near a cave.

5
00:00:16.936 --> 00:00:18.904
One was a crocodile demon.

6
00:00:18.905 --> 00:00:20.824
The other one looked like a plant.

7
00:00:20.825 --> 00:00:25.158
"I'm glad we caught the Tang Monk," the crocodile demon said.

8
00:00:25.159 --> 00:00:27.643
"I can't wait for dinner!"

9
00:00:27.644 --> 00:00:29.543
The plant demon grinned.

10
00:00:29.544 --> 00:00:34.310
"I can't wait to live forever. Our friends will be jealous."

11
00:00:34.311 --> 00:00:39.683
They laughed, and the plant demon fell off the log. Bonk!

12
00:00:39.684 --> 00:00:43.439
Then they laughed even harder.

13
00:00:43.440 --> 00:00:47.334
Wukong shook his head. "These demons are dumb."

14
00:00:47.335 --> 00:00:50.491
He recited a spell and turned into a frog.

15
00:00:50.492 --> 00:00:53.299
He hopped over to the demons.

16
00:00:53.300 --> 00:00:56.762
"Are you really going to eat the Tang Monk?"

17
00:00:56.763 --> 00:01:01.799
The crocodile demon nodded. "We'll eat his companions too."

18
00:01:01.800 --> 00:01:05.688
"But he has three companions," Wukong said.

19
00:01:05.689 --> 00:01:09.673
"That'll be a huge meal. You'll get a stomachache!"

20
00:01:09.674 --> 00:01:12.439
"Nah," the plant demon said.

21
00:01:12.440 --> 00:01:17.975
"He only has two companions—a pig and a purple fellow."

22
00:01:17.976 --> 00:01:22.832
Wukong raised an eyebrow. "What about Sun Wukong?"

23
00:01:22.833 --> 00:01:27.329
The plant demon gulped. "I thought he left the Tang Monk."

24
00:01:27.330 --> 00:01:33.142
The crocodile demon trembled. "Is Sun Wukong still around?"

25
00:01:33.143 --> 00:01:37.216
"Yep!" Wukong returned to his true form.

26
00:01:37.217 --> 00:01:40.923
"Ahh!" The demons ran away.

27
00:01:40.924 --> 00:01:45.829
Wukong laughed and walked toward the cave.

28
00:01:45.830 --> 00:01:49.059
His friends were already coming out.

29
00:01:49.060 --> 00:01:54.152
Sha Wujing smiled. "We escaped on our own this time, Wukong."

30
00:01:54.153 --> 00:01:57.752
"Yeah, Wukong!" Zhu Bajie puffed his chest.

31
00:01:57.753 --> 00:01:59.899
"We didn't need your help."

32
00:01:59.900 --> 00:02:05.184
"Are you kidding?" Wukong snapped. "I scared off the demons!"

33
00:02:05.185 --> 00:02:07.952
"Please don't argue," the Tang Monk said.

34
00:02:07.953 --> 00:02:10.179
"You're all very helpful."

35
00:02:10.180 --> 00:02:15.428
Suddenly a portal appeared. A creature wearing armor stepped out.

36
00:02:15.429 --> 00:02:18.819
"I'm looking for Sun Wukong."

37
00:02:18.820 --> 00:02:22.136
"Oh, really?" Wukong grinned.

38
00:02:22.137 --> 00:02:24.639
"Do you know what he looks like?"

39
00:02:24.640 --> 00:02:30.899
"No," the creature said. "But he's probably huge and scary."

40
00:02:30.900 --> 00:02:34.232
"Why do you think that?" Wukong asked.

41
00:02:34.233 --> 00:02:38.449
"I met several demons," the creature said.

42
00:02:38.450 --> 00:02:42.194
"They're all scared of Sun Wukong."

43
00:02:42.195 --> 00:02:44.888
"That's true," Wukong said.

44
00:02:44.889 --> 00:02:47.556
"Demons are afraid of me."

45
00:02:47.557 --> 00:02:52.424
The creature tilted its head. "You're Sun Wukong?"

46
00:02:52.425 --> 00:02:54.243
"Yes."

47
00:02:54.244 --> 00:02:57.479
The creature burst into laughter.

48
00:02:57.480 --> 00:03:00.713
Wukong frowned. "Why are you laughing?"

49
00:03:00.714 --> 00:03:03.772
"You're a monkey," he said.

50
00:03:03.773 --> 00:03:08.249
Now Bajie laughed. "Yeah, he's our pet monkey!

51
00:03:08.250 --> 00:03:10.591
His name is Sprinkles."

52
00:03:10.592 --> 00:03:14.112
Wukong spun around. "Be quiet, Bajie!"

53
00:03:14.113 --> 00:03:15.899
He turned back to the creature.

54
00:03:15.900 --> 00:03:19.695
"I once defeated Heaven's entire army."

55
00:03:19.696 --> 00:03:23.796
"That's not true." Bajie laughed.

56
00:03:23.797 --> 00:03:25.662
"Don't listen to him."

57
00:03:25.663 --> 00:03:30.310
"Grr!" Wukong pulled out his iron bar.

58
00:03:30.311 --> 00:03:34.475
He grew bigger.

59
00:03:34.476 --> 00:03:39.725
Bajie stopped laughing. "Calm down, Wukong. I'm only joking."

60
00:03:39.726 --> 00:03:46.430
"Aha!" the creature said. "You are Sun Wukong."

61
00:03:46.431 --> 00:03:53.861
Wukong sighed. "Yes. Now tell me what . . . Hey!"

62
00:03:53.862 --> 00:03:56.983
An invisible force pulled Wukong toward the portal.

63
00:03:56.984 --> 00:04:01.869
The Tang Monk gasped as Wujing and Bajie tried to draw their weapons.

64
00:04:01.870 --> 00:04:11.368
"I can't . . . move!" Wujing said.

65
00:04:11.369 --> 00:04:15.119
The portal closed behind Wukong.

66
00:04:15.120 --> 00:04:17.772
He was now in a clear cube.

67
00:04:17.773 --> 00:04:22.507
"Let me out!" Wukong swung his iron bar. Bam!

68
00:04:22.508 --> 00:04:24.041
But the wall didn't break.

69
00:04:24.042 --> 00:04:28.928
Wukong punched and kicked and shouted.

70
00:04:28.929 --> 00:04:33.754
Finally he gave up. "How will I get out of here?"

71
00:04:33.755 --> 00:04:38.152
Later the Battle Master explained the rules of the Galactic Battle Bonanza.

72
00:04:38.153 --> 00:04:42.399
Wukong felt better. "I'll just destroy every other fighter.

73
00:04:42.400 --> 00:04:47.938
This will be easy—and fun!"

